# Auth

- Staging and production each have their **own** GitHub OAuth App (one callback URL per App).
- `AUTH_URL` = site **origin only** (`https://www.chenguo.dev` or `https://staging.chenguo.dev`). Never include `/api/auth/...`.
- Staging callback: `https://staging.chenguo.dev/api/auth/callback/github`
- Keep `trustHost: true` and `normalizeAuthUrl()` in `src/lib/auth.ts`.
- Do not add `AUTH_REDIRECT_PROXY_URL` for the staging model.
- Preview env must not use production `AUTH_URL`.
- `ADMIN_GITHUB_USERNAME` gates writes; any signed-in GitHub user may comment.
